    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>- chloro - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;- methylpentane on reaction with sodium methoxide in methanol yields:<br /><br />(i) <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image26-9f76e861-1a2c-4ae1-a78a-0c87afd0ee14.png\" style=\"height: 145px; width: 200px;\" /><br /><br />(ii) <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image27-288ab881-f90e-49d1-8615-d2039db73687.png\" style=\"height: 81px; width: 200px;\" /><br /><br />(iii) <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image28-31e7583f-5ca6-4813-a89b-4933cb7c6b94.png\" style=\"height: 79px; width: 200px;\" />",
