  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When given reactant reacts with the sodium methoxide solution then both substitution and elimination reactions are possible.</p><p>Substitution reaction gives the following product through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></msub></math>&nbsp;reaction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will give the following products<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image29-38fbee92-8e46-467c-a284-85200932d56e.jpg\" /><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/135071.png\" style=\"width: 674px; height: 200px;\" /></p>",
